# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OZINT configuration. Copy to `.env` and fill in only what you need.
#
# EVERY VARIABLE HERE IS OPTIONAL. With an empty file, 45 keyless tools
# still run — GitHub, RDAP, DNS, Certspotter, Hacker News, Mastodon, Gravatar,
# Nominatim, Overpass, GeoConfirmed, CISA KEV, EPSS, NVD, InternetDB, PeeringDB
# and more. A key arms extra tools; it never unlocks a feature you already had.
#
# The cockpit tells you which tools are armed and which were skipped for a
# missing key, per layer, so you can see exactly what a key would buy you.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Server ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Port for the API + the built cockpit. Binds 127.0.0.1 only.
PORT=3000
# Where investigations, uploaded media and the freeze record are kept.
OZINT_DATA_DIR=.data
# Overrides OZINT_DATA_DIR/ozint.db if you want the database elsewhere.
# OZINT_DB_PATH=
# The built web cockpit the server serves as static files.
OZINT_WEB_DIST=web/dist

# ── The optional LLM tier ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used in exactly two places, both of which degrade honestly when unset:
#   - the one-paragraph narration of a settled layer
#   - the escalation path for a seed whose type is genuinely ambiguous
# None of the OSINT tools call a model. Findings are deterministic by design.
#
# Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint works: OpenAI, OpenRouter, Groq, Together,
# or a local Ollama / llama.cpp server.
# OZINT_LLM_API_KEY=
# OZINT_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# OZINT_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
#
# Local Ollama example:
# OZINT_LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
# OZINT_LLM_API_KEY=ollama
# OZINT_LLM_MODEL=llama3.1

# ── Free API keys, all self-serve ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Malware and reputation
# VIRUSTOTAL_API_KEY=            # virustotal.com — hash, domain, IP reputation
# ABUSECH_API_KEY=               # abuse.ch — MalwareBazaar, URLhaus
# ALIENVAULT_OTX_KEY=            # otx.alienvault.com — hash pulses
# HYBRID_ANALYSIS_KEY=           # hybrid-analysis.com — sandbox reports
# POLYSWARM_API_KEY=             # polyswarm.io — multi-engine hash verdicts
# ABUSEIPDB_API_KEY=             # abuseipdb.com — IP abuse reports
# GREYNOISE_API_KEY=             # greynoise.io — internet background noise
# CENSYS_API_SECRET=             # censys.io — host scan data
# NETLAS_API_KEY=                # netlas.io — host scan data

# Identity and media
# SAUCENAO_API_KEY=              # saucenao.com — reverse image search
# VERIPHONE_API_KEY=             # veriphone.io — phone line type and carrier
# YOUTUBE_API_KEY=               # Google Cloud — YouTube channel and video metadata
# GITHUB_TOKEN=                  # raises GitHub from 60 to 5000 requests/hour

# Vulnerabilities
# NVD_API_KEY=                   # nvd.nist.gov — raises the NVD rate limit

# Offline geolocation (download the MMDB yourself, it is not redistributable)
# MAXMIND_LICENSE_KEY=
